# CODEOWNERS
#
# Two jobs, in this order of importance.
#
# 1. Make the customization files review-critical. Copilot reads these files and then acts
#    on what they say, so an unreviewed edit here is an unreviewed change to agent
#    behaviour. Pair this file with the "Require review from Code Owners" branch rule,
#    otherwise it is documentation rather than enforcement.
#
# 2. Route the areas that need domain review to the people who know them.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner> [<owner> ...]
# Later patterns win, so the most specific rule goes last.

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                                   @your-org/maintainers

# The customization surface. Every file Copilot reads or executes lives here.
/.github/copilot-instructions.md    @your-org/ai-governance
/AGENTS.md                          @your-org/ai-governance
/REVIEW.md                          @your-org/ai-governance
/.github/instructions/              @your-org/ai-governance
/.github/agents/                    @your-org/ai-governance
/.github/prompts/                   @your-org/ai-governance
/.github/skills/                    @your-org/ai-governance

# Hooks execute shell commands without asking the model for permission. Treat them as
# privileged code: they are the one customization that can act on its own.
/.github/hooks/                     @your-org/ai-governance @your-org/security

# Environment and policy. These change what the agent can reach and what CI will run.
/.github/workflows/copilot-setup-steps.yml  @your-org/ai-governance @your-org/platform
/.github/workflows/copilot-code-review.yml  @your-org/ai-governance @your-org/platform
/.github/workflows/                         @your-org/platform
/.vscode/mcp.json                   @your-org/ai-governance @your-org/security

# The fixture the labs operate on. Changing it invalidates the labs, so it is reviewed by
# whoever owns the curriculum rather than by whoever owns the code.
/examples/                          @your-org/docs

# Validator and its tests move together.
/scripts/                           @your-org/ai-governance @your-org/platform
